{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"SST.OpenCodeDesktop","latestVersion":"1.19.5","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"OpenCode is an open source agent that helps you write and run code with any AI model. It's available as a terminal-based interface, desktop app, or IDE extension.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"OpenCode is an open source agent that helps you write and run code with any AI model. It's available as a terminal-based interface, desktop app, or IDE extension.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"opencode is an AI coding agent. It features:\n- A responsive, native, themeable terminal UI and desktop app.\n- Automatically loads the right LSPs, so the LLMs make fewer mistakes.\n- Have multiple agents working in parallel on the same project.\n- Create shareable links to any session for reference or to debug.\n- Log in with Anthropic to use your Claude Pro or Claude Max account.\n- Supports 75+ LLM providers through Models.dev, including local models.","name":"OpenCode","packageUrl":"https://opencode.ai/","publisher":"OpenCode","publisherUrl":"https://anoma.ly/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v1.19.5","tags":["ai","code","coding","develop","development","programming"]}},"longDescription":"opencode is an AI coding agent. It features:\n- A responsive, native, themeable terminal UI and desktop app.\n- Automatically loads the right LSPs, so the LLMs make fewer mistakes.\n- Have multiple agents working in parallel on the same project.\n- Create shareable links to any session for reference or to debug.\n- Log in with Anthropic to use your Claude Pro or Claude Max account.\n- Supports 75+ LLM providers through Models.dev, including local models.","name":"OpenCode","packageUrl":"https://opencode.ai/","